      "about": null,
      "meaning": "The hospital's initial stock is 15 units. It receives the Tuesday shipment (150 units) on Tuesday evening, and the Thursday shipment (150 units) on Thursday evening. So by Friday noon, it holds 15 + 150 + 150 = 315 units. This is certain.",
      "topic": "hospital_holds_units_at_deadline"
    },
    {
      "about": null,
      "meaning": "The Tuesday shipment departs at 4 PM and takes about 3 hours, so it arrives around 7 PM Tuesday. The hospital receives it into its bank. This is known, so no uncertainty.",
      "topic": "tuesday_shipment_arrives"
    },
    {
      "about": "event:thursday_shipment_arrives",
      "meaning": "The Thursday shipment departs at 4 PM and takes about 3 hours, arriving around 7 PM Thursday. The deadline is Friday noon, so it arrives before the deadline. This is known."
    },
    {
      "about": "process:collection_process_monday_to_thursday",
      "meaning": "The exact number of units collected each day is unknown because the drive operates at an average rate of 12 units per hour, but actual hourly yields may vary. Also, it is unclear whether the centre's stock after collection on Thursday (before the 4 PM shipment) is sufficient to fill the 150-unit cooler, or if there is a shortfall."
    },
